What `og:` tags does `/blog` render?

```tsx
// app/layout.tsx
export const metadata = {
  metadataBase: new URL('https://acme.com'),
  openGraph: { title: 'Acme', description: 'We build rockets', images: '/og.png' },
}
// app/blog/page.tsx
export const metadata = { openGraph: { title: 'Blog' } }
```

The root layout sets `title: { template: '%s | Acme', default: 'Acme' }`. What is the document title of `/login`?

```tsx
// app/login/page.tsx
export const metadata = { title: { absolute: 'Sign in to Acme' } }
```

After upgrading from Next.js 15 to 16, `/shop/[slug]` share cards show "undefined" for the product name. What is the cause?

```tsx
// app/shop/[slug]/opengraph-image.tsx
export default async function Image({ params }) {
  const product = await getProduct(params.slug)
  return new ImageResponse(<div>{product?.name}</div>)
}
```
